From 9003c7fd815914e06d2b092b12867b7682161898 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rawdanger-recomp <rawdanger-recomp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:54:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rawdanger-recomp v0.9.5: the wet look and the Debug tab

How wet the hero's worn clothes are (PS2_HERO_WET: the game's thing pool);
the hero's limbs projected with the game's world-to-screen matrix into
capsules that the AO pass darkens and saturates at the hero's depth
(Settings > Picture > Wet look, on). Settings > Debug gathers the test
switches: Where am I, heal/keep, dry/soak, a forced wetness, the capsules
shown, a fixed head turn, the developers' menus.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QNLFPekqhcU2dj7B3Utmea
